#   out[n, co, oz] = sum_{ci,k} A[n, gid*CA_g + ci, gather(oz,k)] * Wt[k, ci, co]
# Two independent terms share one accumulator, plus an optional bias broadcast.
# Tile/warp/stage choice is left to a bounded autotune list; every entry stays
# inside the shared-memory envelope proven by preflight.
